 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "Last time,",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 0.497,
   "w0": 0,
   "w1": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "every monkey was gone.",
   "start": 0.497,
   "end": 2.235,
   "w0": 2,
   "w1": 5
  },
  {
   "text": "All I found were claw prints...",
   "start": 2.543,
   "end": 3.961,
   "w0": 6,
   "w1": 11
  },
  {
   "text": "bigger than my whole body.",
   "start": 3.961,
   "end": 5.852,
   "w0": 12,
   "w1": 16
  },
  {
   "text": "I followed them to a cave.",
   "start": 6.355,
   "end": 7.756,
   "w0": 17,
   "w1": 22
  },
  {
   "text": "Inside:",
   "start": 8.155,
   "end": 8.764,
   "w0": 23,
   "w1": 23
  },
  {
   "text": "the Demon King of Havoc.",
   "start": 9.052,
   "end": 10.707,
   "w0": 24,
   "w1": 28
  },
  {
   "text": "He laughed.",
   "start": 10.982,
   "end": 12.187,
   "w0": 29,
   "w1": 30
  },
  {
   "text": "\"You're the Monkey King?",
   "start": 12.554,
   "end": 13.63,
   "w0": 31,
   "w1": 34
  },
  {
   "text": "You're the size of a peanut!\"",
   "start": 13.987,
   "end": 15.244,
   "w0": 35,
   "w1": 40
  },
  {
   "text": "So I pulled out my own hair...",
   "start": 15.7,
   "end": 17.233,
   "w0": 41,
   "w1": 47
  },
  {
   "text": "and blew.",
   "start": 17.468,
   "end": 18.096,
   "w0": 48,
   "w1": 49
  },
  {
   "text": "Every hair turned into a tiny me.",
   "start": 18.616,
   "end": 20.763,
   "w0": 50,
   "w1": 56
  },
  {
   "text": "Hundreds of them.",
   "start": 21.152,
   "end": 21.997,
   "w0": 57,
   "w1": 59
  },
  {
   "text": "They pinched him,",
   "start": 22.347,
   "end": 23.514,
   "w0": 60,
   "w1": 62
  },
  {
   "text": "poked him...",
   "start": 23.514,
   "end": 24.389,
   "w0": 63,
   "w1": 64
  },
  {
   "text": "and I bonked him with his own sword.",
   "start": 24.587,
   "end": 26.372,
   "w0": 65,
   "w1": 72
  },
  {
   "text": "I saved every monkey.",
   "start": 26.765,
   "end": 28.228,
   "w0": 73,
   "w1": 76
  },
  {
   "text": "But I needed a real weapon.",
   "start": 28.662,
   "end": 30.049,
   "w0": 77,
   "w1": 82
  },
  {
   "text": "Under the ocean,",
   "start": 30.541,
   "end": 31.355,
   "w0": 83,
   "w1": 85
  },
  {
   "text": "the Dragon King kept a treasure no one could lift.",
   "start": 31.543,
   "end": 34.186,
   "w0": 86,
   "w1": 95
  },
  {
   "text": "He gave me a sword.",
   "start": 34.636,
   "end": 35.627,
   "w0": 96,
   "w1": 100
  },
  {
   "text": "Too light.",
   "start": 35.967,
   "end": 36.47,
   "w0": 101,
   "w1": 102
  },
  {
   "text": "A spear.",
   "start": 36.789,
   "end": 37.312,
   "w0": 103,
   "w1": 104
  },
  {
   "text": "Too light.",
   "start": 37.66,
   "end": 38.22,
   "w0": 105,
   "w1": 106
  },
  {
   "text": "A giant fork.",
   "start": 38.577,
   "end": 39.627,
   "w0": 107,
   "w1": 109
  },
  {
   "text": "Snapped it like a breadstick.",
   "start": 39.833,
   "end": 41.275,
   "w0": 110,
   "w1": 114
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the palace started shaking.",
   "start": 41.766,
   "end": 43.48,
   "w0": 115,
   "w1": 119
  },
  {
   "text": "A golden iron pillar.",
   "start": 43.903,
   "end": 45.237,
   "w0": 120,
   "w1": 123
  },
  {
   "text": "Glowing.",
   "start": 45.551,
   "end": 46.114,
   "w0": 124,
   "w1": 124
  },
  {
   "text": "Waiting for me.",
   "start": 46.512,
   "end": 47.876,
   "w0": 125,
   "w1": 127
  },
  {
   "text": "Eight tons.",
   "start": 48.069,
   "end": 48.622,
   "w0": 128,
   "w1": 129
  },
  {
   "text": "And it could change size.",
   "start": 49.008,
   "end": 50.302,
   "w0": 130,
   "w1": 134
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Smaller!\"",
   "start": 50.61,
   "end": 51.26,
   "w0": 135,
   "w1": 135
  },
  {
   "text": "A needle.",
   "start": 51.582,
   "end": 52.064,
   "w0": 136,
   "w1": 137
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Bigger!\"",
   "start": 52.416,
   "end": 52.861,
   "w0": 138,
   "w1": 138
  },
  {
   "text": "It touched the ocean floor.",
   "start": 53.198,
   "end": 54.58,
   "w0": 139,
   "w1": 143
  },
  {
   "text": "I tucked it behind my ear.",
   "start": 54.933,
   "end": 56.2,
   "w0": 144,
   "w1": 149
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Thanks.",
   "start": 56.558,
   "end": 56.966,
   "w0": 150,
   "w1": 150
  },
  {
   "text": "I'll take it.\"",
   "start": 57.185,
   "end": 57.615,
   "w0": 151,
   "w1": 153
  },
  {
   "text": "That night,",
   "start": 58.083,
   "end": 58.723,
   "w0": 154,
   "w1": 155
  },
  {
   "text": "two men in black chained me and dragged me to the Underworld.",
   "start": 59.018,
   "end": 62.253,
   "w0": 156,
   "w1": 167
  },
  {
   "text": "They opened the Book of Life and Death.",
   "start": 62.687,
   "end": 64.643,
   "w0": 168,
   "w1": 175
  },
  {
   "text": "My name:",
   "start": 65.085,
   "end": 65.611,
   "w0": 176,
   "w1": 177
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Sun Wukong.",
   "start": 65.987,
   "end": 66.89,
   "w0": 178,
   "w1": 179
  },
  {
   "text": "Dies...",
   "start": 67.355,
   "end": 67.959,
   "w0": 180,
   "w1": 180
  },
  {
   "text": "tonight.\"",
   "start": 68.281,
   "end": 68.811,
   "w0": 181,
   "w1": 181
  },
  {
   "text": "So I grabbed their brush...",
   "start": 69.209,
   "end": 70.526,
   "w0": 182,
   "w1": 186
  },
  {
   "text": "and crossed it out.",
   "start": 70.526,
   "end": 71.624,
   "w0": 187,
   "w1": 190
  },
  {
   "text": "Mine,",
   "start": 71.951,
   "end": 72.196,
   "w0": 191,
   "w1": 191
  },
  {
   "text": "and every monkey's.",
   "start": 72.196,
   "end": 73.668,
   "w0": 192,
   "w1": 194
  },
  {
   "text": "Forever.",
   "start": 73.949,
   "end": 74.5,
   "w0": 195,
   "w1": 195
  },
  {
   "text": "Up in heaven,",
   "start": 74.94,
   "end": 75.674,
   "w0": 196,
   "w1": 198
  },
  {
   "text": "the Jade Emperor slammed down his tea.",
   "start": 75.938,
   "end": 78.161,
   "w0": 199,
   "w1": 205
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Bring me...",
   "start": 78.752,
   "end": 79.41,
   "w0": 206,
   "w1": 207
  },
  {
   "text": "that monkey.\"",
   "start": 79.41,
   "end": 80.397,
   "w0": 208,
   "w1": 209
  },
  {
   "text": "Part three.",
   "start": 80.856,
   "end": 81.408,
   "w0": 210,
   "w1": 211
  },
  {
   "text": "Follow so you don't miss it.",
   "start": 81.736,
   "end": 83.004,
   "w0": 212,
   "w1": 217
  }
 ]
